{
  "item": "BloodCastle02",
  "mu_name": "Messenger of Archangel",
  "mu_name_from": "NPC/BloodCastle02.bmd, loaded as MODEL_NPC_ARCHANGEL_MESSENGER (ZzzOpenData.cpp:1923-1926), MuMain's MONSTER_MESSENGER_OF_ARCH at scale 1 (ZzzCharacter.cpp:14357-14363). Type 233, OpenMU's 'Messenger of Arch.' with NpcWindow.BloodCastle. Not Version075's: OpenMU's Season Six stands him in Devias at 217,29 and 217,20 facing SouthEast (VersionSeasonSix/Maps/Devias.cs:45-46).",
  "world": "devias",
  "object_type": -1,
  "why_this_one": "The user asked for Blood Castle's NPC in Devias (2026-09-30). One figure in pale blue plate with a sword, 834 triangles on three sheets. Blood Castle is not written, so he stands and says so.",
  "profile": "npc",
  "sheets": {
    "ng01": "npc_ng01.png",
    "skin_barbarian_01": "skin_barbarian_01.png",
    "ju01_R": "npc_ju01_r.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Out of Data/NPC, beside the model. ng01 and ju01_R decoded under an npc_ prefix; skin_barbarian_01 is the same sheet already in source/textures, byte for byte, so it is shared.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "ng01": "plate_steel",
    "skin_barbarian_01": "skin",
    "ju01_R": "lamplight"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "ng01 is his plate and sword and nothing else, so plate_steel, as the vault keeper's plate. skin_barbarian_01 carries his face, hair and the black cloth under the plate, so skin, as every townsperson's shared page. ju01_R is four triangles of feather and flame on black.",
  "glow": {
    "ng01": {
      "over": true
    },
    "ju01_R": {}
  },
  "glow_from": "ju01_R is an _R sheet, which MU's BMD draws added: the two wings are four triangles of white feather on black, so black adds nothing and the feathers add themselves.\n\nng01 is drawn twice, as MU draws it: once opaque in the bake and again added, `over` -- Draw_RenderObject's RENDER_TEXTURE | RENDER_BRIGHT pass of mesh 0 for the Messenger and the Archangel (ZzzObject.cpp:2644-2647), which is what turns his dark painted plate the shining pale blue the user's reference shows (2026-09-30).\n\nBoth {} otherwise: nothing in MoveCharacterVisual or RenderCharacter moves his BlendMeshLight or texture coordinates -- steady, no pulse, no scroll.",
  "islands_from": "The build fills this.",
